      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fourteen is fourteen, forty is forty."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "这是一个绕口令，很多中国人都知道。",
      "traditional": "這是一個繞口令，很多中國人都知道。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì yí ge rào kǒu lìng hěn duō zhōng guó rén dōu zhī dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "要读好这个绕口令，就要知道拼音“s”和“sh”发音的不同。",
      "traditional": "要讀好這個繞口令，就要知道拼音“s”和“sh”發音的不同。",
      "pinyin": "yào dú hǎo zhè ge rào kǒu lìng jiù yào zhī dào pīn yīn 1 hé 1 fā yīn de bù tóng",
      "english": "This is a tongue-twister that a lot of Chinese people know."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "你会读这个绕口令吗？",
      "traditional": "你會讀這個繞口令嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ huì dú zhè ge rào kǒu lìng ma",
      "english": "In order to read this tongue-twister well, you must know the difference in pronunciation between “s” and “sh”."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "试着读快一点儿。",
      "traditional": "試著讀快一點兒。",
      "pinyin": "shì zhe dú kuài yì diǎn'r",
      "english": "Can you read the tongue-twister?"
    },
